t_alarm\"], \"later\": [\"same_wake\", \"get_up_if_awake\", \"screens_down\"]}, {\"id\": \"not_moved\", \"area\": \"exercise\", \"label\": \"I've barely moved today\", \"now\": [\"move_five\", \"daylight\"], \"later\": [\"short_walk\"]}, {\"id\": \"overdid\", \"area\": \"exercise\", \"label\": \"I've pushed my body hard\", \"now\": [\"sit_down\", \"eat_protein\", \"water\"], \"later\": [\"rest_day\"]}], \"areaFirst\": {\"tired\": \"sleep\", \"sleepy\": \"sleep\", \"exhausted\": \"sleep\", \"unfocused\": \"sleep\", \"bored\": \"exercise\", \"apathetic\": \"eating\", \"indifferent\": \"eating\"}, \"check\": [{\"id\": \"rest_restores\", \"label\": \"Rest or food usually brings me back\", \"points\": \"body\"}, {\"id\": \"rest_flat\", \"label\": \"I rest and still get up flat\", \"points\": \"feeling\"}, {\"id\": \"after_event\", \"label\": \"It started after something happened\", \"points\": \"feeling\"}, {\"id\": \"lifts_moving\", \"label\": \"It lifts a bit once I get going\", \"points\": \"feeling\"}, {\"id\": \"cant_tell\", \"label\": \"I can't tell\", \"points\": \"body\"}], \"now\": [{\"id\": \"eat_protein\", \"label\": \"Eat something with some protein in it, soon\"}, {\"id\": \"water\", \"label\": \"Drink a glass of water now\"}, {\"id\": \"real_meal\", \"label\": \"Have a proper meal, even a small one\"}, {\"id\": \"rest_alarm\", \"label\": \"Lie down for 20 minutes with an alarm set\"}, {\"id\": \"daylight\", \"label\": \"Get ten minutes of daylight\"}, {\"id\": \"sick_care\", \"label\": \"Treat it like being sick: rest, fluids, warmth\"}, {\"id\": \"usual_remedy\", \"label\": \"Take what you'd normally take for this\"}, {\"id\": \"meds_check\", \"label\": \"Check what's due and take it as prescribed\"}, {\"id\": \"food_before_decisions\", \"label\": \"Food and water before any big decisions\"}, {\"id\": \"swap_coffee\", \"label\": \"Swap the next coffee for water or food\"}, {\"id\": \"move_five\", \"label\": \"Five minutes outside or by an open window\"}, {\"id\": \"sit_down\", \"label\": \"Sit or lie down for 15 minutes\"}, {\"id\": \"one_thing\", \"label\": \"Shrink today to the one thing that has to happen\"}, {\"id\": \"hand_off\", \"label\": \"Ask someone to take one thing off you\"}], \"nowAlways\": [\"one_thing\", \"hand_off\"], \"later\": [{\"id\": \"same_wake\", \"label\": \"Wake at the same time tomorrow, whatever tonight is like\"}, {\"id\": \"screens_down\", \"label\": \"Screens down 30 minutes before bed\"}, {\"id\": \"get_up_if_awake\", \"label\": \"If I can't sleep after about 20 minutes, get up and do something dull\"}, {\"id\": \"no_late_nap\", \"label\": \"No naps after mid-afternoon\"}, {\"id\": \"first_meal\", \"label\": \"Decide when tomorrow's first meal happens\"}, {\"id\": \"easy_food\", \"label\": \"Have something easy ready to eat\"}, {\"id\": \"skip_alcohol\", \"label\": \"Skip alcohol tonight\"}, {\"id\": \"caffeine_cutoff\", \"label\": \"No caffeine after early afternoon\"}, {\"id\": \"book_it\", \"label\": \"Book the appointment or refill I've been putting off\"}, {\"id\": \"short_walk\", \"label\": \"Plan a short walk for tomorrow\"}, {\"id\": \"rest_day\", \"label\": \"Give my body an easier day tomorrow\"}, {\"id\": \"cope_ahead\", \"label\": \"Plan tomorrow for a tired me: what can come off the list?\"}], \"laterAlways\": [\"cope_ahead\", \"same_wake\"], \"laterMax\": 2, \"copy\": {\"stages\": {\"factors\": \"What's running low\", \"check\": \"Tired or heavy?\", \"now\": \"Right now\", \"later\": \"Protect tomorrow\", \"done\": \"Your plan\"}, \"factors\": {\"title\": \"Is your body part of this?\", \"body\": \"Running low on sleep, food or health makes every feeling louder and every task heavier. Pick anything that's true today, even a little.\", \"ownLabel\": \"Something else running low\", \"ownPlaceholder\": \"In your own words\", \"none\": \"None of these\", \"next\": \"Next\"}, \"check\": {\"title\": \"Tired, or heavy?\", \"body\": \"Sadness, hopelessness and shame can feel like tiredness from the inside. Which of these sounds like you?\", \"next\": \"Next\"}, \"feeling\": {\"title\": \"This might be a feeling that looks like tiredness\", \"body\": \"When rest doesn't refill you, or the heaviness came with something that happened, it's often an emotion pulling you to lie low. Resting can feed that. Naming it, or doing the opposite of the pull, tends to help more.\", \"findTheFeeling\": \"Find the word for it\", \"oppositeAction\": \"Do the opposite of the pull\", \"continue\": \"Look after my body first anyway\"}, \"now\": {\"title\": \"One thing for right now\", \"body\": \"Pick the smallest one you'd actually do. Doing less today is part of the skill.\", \"ownLabel\": \"Something else\", \"ownPlaceholder\": \"What would help your body right now?\", \"next\": \"Next\"}, \"later\": {\"title\": \"Protect tomorrow\", \"body\": \"Pick up to two. Tired days run on yesterday's choices.\", \"next\": \"See my plan\", \"skip\": \"Skip this for today\"}, \"done\": {\"title\": \"Looking after your body is the skill\", \"body\": \"Feelings run hotter on an empty tank. Here's what you picked.\", \"nowLabel\": \"Right now\", \"laterLabel\": \"For tomorrow\", \"footnote\": \"Nothing you picked here is saved.\", \"restart\": \"Start over\", \"otherTools\": \"Explore other tools\"}}}";
